      "name": "Internal business",
      "color": "#2f7a6e",
      "description": "<p>The non-billable backbone of the studio: cashflow, contracts, CRM hygiene, and a thin marketing rhythm so client work never stalls for lack of ops.</p><h2>This quarter’s rhythm</h2><table><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Lane</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Ritual</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Cadence</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Finance</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Invoice template + tax packet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Monthly</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Admin</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>CRM cleanup + contracts</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Biweekly</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Marketing</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>LinkedIn batch + portfolio</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Weekly</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Tool stack</h2><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://stripe.com/dashboard\">Stripe</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets\">Cashflow sheet</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.notion.so\">Ops wiki</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company\">Studio page</a></p></li></ul><blockquote><p>Protect Fridays for deep work — invoices and outreach can wait until Monday.</p></blockquote><h2>How to close the books</h2><ol><li><p>Export Stripe payouts and match every invoice</p></li><li><p>Drop receipts into the accountant folder</p></li><li><p>Mark stale CRM leads and log wins</p></li></ol>",
