      "name": "Client project B",
      "color": "#6b4f8c",
      "description": "<p><strong>Launch window:</strong> land the waitlist page, wire the signup flow, and clear the go-live checklist before DNS flips. Pricing and press kit are already green.</p><h2>How to go live (launch day)</h2><ol><li><p>Freeze hero copy — no more “one last tweak”</p></li><li><p>Deploy production, flip DNS, confirm SSL</p></li><li><p>Submit a real waitlist email end-to-end</p></li><li><p>Drop the press kit and post socials within the hour</p></li></ol><h2>Countdown board</h2><table><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Workstream</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>State</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Blocker</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Landing hero copy</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Today</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Final CTA wording</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Waitlist signup</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Today</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>ESP template</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Pricing section</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Done</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>—</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Onboarding emails</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Next week</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Post-launch</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Launch stack</h2><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://launch.client-b.example.com\">Landing preview</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.figma.com/file/client-b-launch\">Final art</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://vercel.com/studio/client-b\">Deploy</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/client-b-press\">Press kit</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nor