      "slug": "conference-booth",
      "name": "Conference booth",
      "color": "#3d6a8c",
      "description": "<p><em>Archived · post-show</em> — booth layout, print production, and on-site runbook for the trade show. Kept for vendor contacts and reprint specs next year.</p><h2>Vendors &amp; floor</h2><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.figma.com/file/booth-layout\">Booth layout (floor + elevations)</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://prints.vendor.example.com/jobs/booth\">Print vendor portal</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://freight.vendor.example.com\">Freight booking</a></p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://expo.example.com/hall-b/booth-214\">Hall B · booth 214 map</a></p></li></ul><h2>Print specs (as built)</h2><table><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Piece</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Size</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Material</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Qty</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Back wall</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>3 × 2.5 m</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Tension fabric</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Counter wrap</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>1.2 × 0.9 m</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Vinyl</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Handouts</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>A5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>300gsm matte</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>500</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Spare banner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>2 × 0.8 m</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Roll-up</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2>How to wrap booth production</h2><ol><li><p>Sign off layout + lighting before files leave the studio</p></li><li><p>Export print-ready PDF with 3 mm bleed and crop marks</p></li><li><p>Lock the freight window with the fabricator in writing</p></li><li><p>Day-of: spare banner, gaffer, and a charged label printer</p></li></ol><blockquote><p>If the booth reads from ten meters away, the collateral can whisper.</p></blockquote>",
